  <p id="c-beishi-042-wangyi:p001" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-beishi-042-wangyi:p001:m0000" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AAAA">翊</persName>字<persName id="c-beishi-042-wangyi:p001:m0002" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AAAA">士遊</persName>，<persName id="c-beishi-042-wangyi:p001:m0005" ref="l1w_swd_dj8">肅</persName>次兄<persName id="c-beishi-042-wangyi:p001:m0008" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_AAA">深</persName>子也。</p>
  <p id="c-beishi-042-wangyi:p002" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">卒，贈司空公、徐州刺史。子琛，武定中，儀同、開府記室參軍。</p>
